colibri
-------

apus's tiered expert-store design (NVMe slab store, bounded RAM cache with
LFRU eviction and hysteresis pins, RSS guard, usage persistence) and the
router-lookahead prefetch "pilot" follow the design of, and adapt code
from, colibri:

    https://github.com/JustVugg/colibri

